(5667167, 823708, 10785, '<td valign="top">You did good on this shot. I tried something similar and it turned out bad so I did not enter. Nice exposure between the light and the dark background. That is hard to do. Your light is slightly off center. Whether by design or not, I don''t know. I would say a square crop without as much negative space would be more compelling.</td>', 'You did good on this shot. I tried something similar and it turned out bad so I did not enter. Nice exposure between the light and the dark background. That is hard to do. Your light is slightly off center. Whether by design or not, I don''t know. I would say a square crop without as much negative space would be more compelling.', '2009-09-30 09:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5667168, 823770, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great color and excellent exposure between the light and the dark background. That is hard to do. There is some dust on the bulb that shows up which isn''t very appealing. The square crop is great however your subject is slightly off center, whether by design or not I don''t know.</td>', 'Great color and excellent exposure between the light and the dark background. That is hard to do. There is some dust on the bulb that shows up which isn''t very appealing. The square crop is great however your subject is slightly off center, whether by design or not I don''t know.', '2009-09-30 09:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
