(5667174, 824175, 10785, '<td valign="top">a square crop to center the subject would have been better than having it off center. HOwever great subject and excellent painting with light photo.</td>', 'a square crop to center the subject would have been better than having it off center. HOwever great subject and excellent painting with light photo.', '2009-09-30 09:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
