(5669143, 823773, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>I like the feel of this shot. It sets a great mood. Too soft for my tastes, and maybe slightly tilted, hard to tell. The framing is wonderful though with that one light up in the upper right hand corner. I love that.<br/> <br/>HTH</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  I like the feel of this shot. It sets a great mood. Too soft for my tastes, and maybe slightly tilted, hard to tell. The framing is wonderful though with that one light up in the upper right hand corner. I love that. HTH', '2009-10-01 10:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669147, 824405, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/> <br/>Fantastic color and clarity. I don''t however see what''s twisted or curved about this. there are a few different curves in it but none really seem to be the focus. The straight lines that flow through the frame so wonderfully actually seem more like the focus to me. <br/> <br/>HTH</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*   Fantastic color and clarity. I don''t however see what''s twisted or curved about this. there are a few different curves in it but none really seem to be the focus. The straight lines that flow through the frame so wonderfully actually seem more like the focus to me.  HTH', '2009-10-01 10:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669149, 824469, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/> <br/>Ohhh...... holy #@%&amp; that''s cool! This is wonderful. Seems maybe a bit dirty/noisy with all those black dots but that is my only nitpick. If the color were smoother without all the speckled black marks this would be absolutely stunning.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*   Ohhh...... holy #@%& that''s cool! This is wonderful. Seems maybe a bit dirty/noisy with all those black dots but that is my only nitpick. If the color were smoother without all the speckled black marks this would be absolutely stunning.', '2009-10-01 10:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669157, 824485, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Very nice. I love the texture on texture on texture. Gives it soooo much edpth and the diamond effect created makes it very dynamic. I''m not sure how I feel about the mottled look of the BG though. does add more texture but something about it rubs me the wrong way. Otherwise wonderful capture though. Well thought out.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Very nice. I love the texture on texture on texture. Gives it soooo much edpth and the diamond effect created makes it very dynamic. I''m not sure how I feel about the mottled look of the BG though. does add more texture but something about it rubs me the wrong way. Otherwise wonderful capture though. Well thought out.', '2009-10-01 10:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669160, 824692, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Amazingly well shot. The colors are perfect for this. DOF is nice. Well done. I hope you are doing well in the challenge.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Amazingly well shot. The colors are perfect for this. DOF is nice. Well done. I hope you are doing well in the challenge.', '2009-10-01 10:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669168, 824669, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Oh so very similar to the blue ribbon in the past twisted challenge. Wouldn''t be surprised if this one took a ribbon as well. You did a wonderful job with this. The complimentary colors are great and getting the ball to stay up there was quite a feat. I love the reflection too. may have been better if you could have avaoided getting your whole room in the reflection as far as others voters go. not sure. but I dig seeing so much in the reflection. Fantastic composition too. Good Luck!</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Oh so very similar to the blue ribbon in the past twisted challenge. Wouldn''t be surprised if this one took a ribbon as well. You did a wonderful job with this. The complimentary colors are great and getting the ball to stay up there was quite a feat. I love the reflection too. may have been better if you could have avaoided getting your whole room in the reflection as far as others voters go. not sure. but I dig seeing so much in the reflection. Fantastic composition too. Good Luck!', '2009-10-01 10:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669171, 823806, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Beautiful subject and wonderful bokeh created by the chain in the back. It looks a bit soft to me. like maybe the focal point was the chain in the front instead of the pendant. Would prefer the pendant in sharp focus instead. great composition though. and the black and white gives it a nice feel.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Beautiful subject and wonderful bokeh created by the chain in the back. It looks a bit soft to me. like maybe the focal point was the chain in the front instead of the pendant. Would prefer the pendant in sharp focus instead. great composition though. and the black and white gives it a nice feel.', '2009-10-01 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669176, 824402, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/> <br/>Wowsa. What a beauty. Her eyes are nearly completely obstructed by her hair and her stare is still piercing. If her hair was out of her eyes I bet this would be Spectacular. The placing of her hand of her tattooed arm is a bit weird. I think one finger is down in the dirt or something because she almost appears to be missing half of a finger. Overall very cool shot though. Beautiful lighting and exposure and Black and white works wonderfully too.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*   Wowsa. What a beauty. Her eyes are nearly completely obstructed by her hair and her stare is still piercing. If her hair was out of her eyes I bet this would be Spectacular. The placing of her hand of her tattooed arm is a bit weird. I think one finger is down in the dirt or something because she almost appears to be missing half of a finger. Overall very cool shot though. Beautiful lighting and exposure and Black and white works wonderfully too.', '2009-10-01 10:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669182, 824156, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>wow. this is pretty cool. Only thing that distracts me is seeing some of the background on the left hand side in the middle. I''d prefer if the books completely filled the frame. And some more dramatic/dynamic editing could really help too. As is it feels a bit snapshotish but has huge amounts of potential.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  wow. this is pretty cool. Only thing that distracts me is seeing some of the background on the left hand side in the middle. I''d prefer if the books completely filled the frame. And some more dramatic/dynamic editing could really help too. As is it feels a bit snapshotish but has huge amounts of potential.', '2009-10-01 10:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669186, 824528, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Wonderful. This was captured perfectly. The black and white and the border enhance it even further. I hope your are doing well in this challenge. Good Luck!</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Wonderful. This was captured perfectly. The black and white and the border enhance it even further. I hope your are doing well in this challenge. Good Luck!', '2009-10-01 10:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669188, 823980, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/> <br/>Very cool. I''d prefer less sky and maybe even a contrasty black and white edit. but still a very nice shot. the clarity is astounding. I hope you are doing well in this challenge.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*   Very cool. I''d prefer less sky and maybe even a contrasty black and white edit. but still a very nice shot. the clarity is astounding. I hope you are doing well in this challenge.', '2009-10-01 10:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
