(5669193, 824343, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>cool capture, never seen anything like it(the plant that is). A larger DOf would be helpful. and removing that distracting branch coming in from the upper left corner. It takes all the focus away from where the focus should be, on those spirals. <br/> <br/>HTH</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  cool capture, never seen anything like it(the plant that is). A larger DOf would be helpful. and removing that distracting branch coming in from the upper left corner. It takes all the focus away from where the focus should be, on those spirals.  HTH', '2009-10-01 10:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
