(5669630, 824692, 30982, '<td valign="top">OK, maybe not what everyone thinks of for "twisted" but you cannot miss with these guys, especially with these colors.  Really nicely done, and I like the detail of the back of the frond on which he''s resting.</td>', 'OK, maybe not what everyone thinks of for "twisted" but you cannot miss with these guys, especially with these colors.  Really nicely done, and I like the detail of the back of the frond on which he''s resting.', '2009-10-01 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669640, 824405, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can see the wheel bits and the car as being curved, but "twisted" or "curved" wouldn''t be the first thing to come to mind outside of the challenge title.  It is, however, well composed and very bold and vibrant.</td>', 'I can see the wheel bits and the car as being curved, but "twisted" or "curved" wouldn''t be the first thing to come to mind outside of the challenge title.  It is, however, well composed and very bold and vibrant.', '2009-10-01 15:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669641, 824619, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  There''s a motorcycle, panned, in Straight, and a car, panned, in Twisted...   Not sure how this meets the challenge (nor was I sure of the motorcycle in the other challenge.)</td>', 'Interesting.  There''s a motorcycle, panned, in Straight, and a car, panned, in Twisted...   Not sure how this meets the challenge (nor was I sure of the motorcycle in the other challenge.)', '2009-10-01 15:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
