(5669649, 824349, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if this references a pop culture icon or character with which I am not familiar?  I guess "twisted" is being used here in the party sense rather than literal.  Not sure that''ll catch on.</td>', 'I''m wondering if this references a pop culture icon or character with which I am not familiar?  I guess "twisted" is being used here in the party sense rather than literal.  Not sure that''ll catch on.', '2009-10-01 15:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669655, 824584, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit of a jumble - the eye (at least mine) can''t really find a place to look or settle.  In meeting the challenge, most of the lines here look more straightish than curved, though I can see where the rocks have been sorta twisted over time.</td>', 'A bit of a jumble - the eye (at least mine) can''t really find a place to look or settle.  In meeting the challenge, most of the lines here look more straightish than curved, though I can see where the rocks have been sorta twisted over time.', '2009-10-01 15:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5669661, 824642, 30982, '<td valign="top">That one rock has a good curve thing going on, but for the challenge, I do think this is a bit of a title-dependent stretch.  Good color in the water, and the people give a good sense of scale to this.</td>', 'That one rock has a good curve thing going on, but for the challenge, I do think this is a bit of a title-dependent stretch.  Good color in the water, and the people give a good sense of scale to this.', '2009-10-01 15:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
