(5669818, 823234, 108580, '<td valign="top">Hmm the rolls of card surface again... :) good DOF, nice pastels, soft, just a pity about the two damaged areas on pink card centre and top, seeing as the shot was "created", flawed a higher score. 8</td>', 'Hmm the rolls of card surface again... :) good DOF, nice pastels, soft, just a pity about the two damaged areas on pink card centre and top, seeing as the shot was "created", flawed a higher score. 8', '2009-10-01 17:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
