(5670321, 824618, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Could use a snappier title, but we don''t always have the muse do we? My title suffers from that this week as well. Nice photo though. The sharpness is right where it needs to be and I like that the screw is the only one with rust, makes it stand out so much more. Nicely done.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Could use a snappier title, but we don''t always have the muse do we? My title suffers from that this week as well. Nice photo though. The sharpness is right where it needs to be and I like that the screw is the only one with rust, makes it stand out so much more. Nicely done.', '2009-10-01 21:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670325, 823845, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Took me a moment realize these were rubber bands. I thought they were some sort of foam at first. Very nice colors and clarity. The background is a nice crisp white and the black border is great too. not sure about the white inner border but that''s my only nitpick.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Took me a moment realize these were rubber bands. I thought they were some sort of foam at first. Very nice colors and clarity. The background is a nice crisp white and the black border is great too. not sure about the white inner border but that''s my only nitpick.', '2009-10-01 21:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5670330, 824473, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>Wonderfully clear and sharp. The composition and colors, even the clarity of the white in the BG are stunning. I''d prefer if the upper lefthand corner were darker. The lightness up there draws my eyes away from the real focus. But overall, very well done.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  Wonderfully clear and sharp. The composition and colors, even the clarity of the white in the BG are stunning. I''d prefer if the upper lefthand corner were darker. The lightness up there draws my eyes away from the real focus. But overall, very well done.', '2009-10-01 21:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
