(5670370, 823856, 56797, '<td valign="top">*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread* <br/> <br/>awww. I adore this image. for personal reasons really. This looks like the exact set up for my very first film photo that I took and developed myself. I was very young and mine looked no where near as good as this one technically. I had TONS of noise but this shot brings back good memories for me. and on it''s own merit it is wonderful as well. Fantastic use of light. You have no harsh highlights. That can be hard to achieve. Wonderfully done. I hope you are doing well in this challenge.</td>', '*not voting as I''m in this challenge-just commenting since I''ve seen requests for comments in the challenge thread*  awww. I adore this image. for personal reasons really. This looks like the exact set up for my very first film photo that I took and developed myself. I was very young and mine looked no where near as good as this one technically. I had TONS of noise but this shot brings back good memories for me. and on it''s own merit it is wonderful as well. Fantastic use of light. You have no harsh highlights. That can be hard to achieve. Wonderfully done. I hope you are doing well in this challenge.', '2009-10-01 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
