(5671300, 823894, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this overall as I think the balloon tops are interesting and your POV is unique.  The one thing I''m not crazy about is the bg being a dirty yellow.  Probably not a choice for you, but it is what it is, eh?  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this overall as I think the balloon tops are interesting and your POV is unique.  The one thing I''m not crazy about is the bg being a dirty yellow.  Probably not a choice for you, but it is what it is, eh?  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 11:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671303, 824679, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is cool.  Looks like a skull or side view of a brain.  :-)  Nice texture and great use of lighting to bring out the details.  Same technique would work well for the Low Key challenge.</td>', 'Hey, this is cool.  Looks like a skull or side view of a brain.  :-)  Nice texture and great use of lighting to bring out the details.  Same technique would work well for the Low Key challenge.', '2009-10-02 11:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671306, 824202, 30049, '<td valign="top">Barbed wire without the barb.  :-)  I like the colortones.  A wee bit of noise introduced in post (probably) that may get a ding or two from some voters.  I tossed a 7 your way on this the first go around (just commenting now).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Barbed wire without the barb.  :-)  I like the colortones.  A wee bit of noise introduced in post (probably) that may get a ding or two from some voters.  I tossed a 7 your way on this the first go around (just commenting now).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 11:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671308, 824567, 30049, '<td valign="top">Coming back around to comment, and I think I scored this too low originall with a 7.  Giving you a slight bump as I really like how you''ve brought out the details on this, yet I can still appreciate the velvet feel the rose petals must have.  Well done!</td>', 'Coming back around to comment, and I think I scored this too low originall with a 7.  Giving you a slight bump as I really like how you''ve brought out the details on this, yet I can still appreciate the velvet feel the rose petals must have.  Well done!', '2009-10-02 11:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671314, 824587, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Looks like an interesting location.  The theme of this works fine for me regarding the challenge it''s entered in - although I imagine it''s not on the mark for everyone.  It''s a little busy.  Also a tad subdued on tonal range (short on highlights IMO).  Still...worthy of a 7 for it''s uniqueness and comp (I voted earlier and just commenting now).  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this.  Looks like an interesting location.  The theme of this works fine for me regarding the challenge it''s entered in - although I imagine it''s not on the mark for everyone.  It''s a little busy.  Also a tad subdued on tonal range (short on highlights IMO).  Still...worthy of a 7 for it''s uniqueness and comp (I voted earlier and just commenting now).  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 11:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671317, 824655, 30049, '<td valign="top">Slinky''s are always good for this type of challenge.  I like how you''ve positioned this, rather than taking the over-used tunnel type shot.  Not sure how the purple color was introduced...makes it feel a bit noisy.  Still, a very nice shot overall.  Good luck.</td>', 'Slinky''s are always good for this type of challenge.  I like how you''ve positioned this, rather than taking the over-used tunnel type shot.  Not sure how the purple color was introduced...makes it feel a bit noisy.  Still, a very nice shot overall.  Good luck.', '2009-10-02 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671348, 824427, 30049, '<td valign="top">I figured we''d see a few like this in the challenge, or at least this approach.  What I like about this is the NON-use of a plain white or black background.  Would like to see both pieces in focus like the one on the right is (left seems to be a little farther back and the back of the curls are OOF).  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I figured we''d see a few like this in the challenge, or at least this approach.  What I like about this is the NON-use of a plain white or black background.  Would like to see both pieces in focus like the one on the right is (left seems to be a little farther back and the back of the curls are OOF).  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671349, 824698, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice way to illuminate the filaments of the lightbulb.  It also helps that I really like blue/black combos.  :-)  Well done!</td>', 'Very nice way to illuminate the filaments of the lightbulb.  It also helps that I really like blue/black combos.  :-)  Well done!', '2009-10-02 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671350, 824645, 30049, '<td valign="top">Gritty texture, yet still interesting.  The dark brown tones are ok...did you try any other colors, or B&amp;W?</td>', 'Gritty texture, yet still interesting.  The dark brown tones are ok...did you try any other colors, or B&W?', '2009-10-02 12:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671352, 823773, 30049, '<td valign="top">Tunnel shots are cool and I''ve done a couple.  I''m trying to figure how you did this without any motion blur.  High shutter speed?  Personally, I like the light trails and streaks that come with motion blur for shots like this, but this is ok too.  Does seem like this needs a levels adjustment as the highlights are dirty gray/brownish.</td>', 'Tunnel shots are cool and I''ve done a couple.  I''m trying to figure how you did this without any motion blur.  High shutter speed?  Personally, I like the light trails and streaks that come with motion blur for shots like this, but this is ok too.  Does seem like this needs a levels adjustment as the highlights are dirty gray/brownish.', '2009-10-02 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671355, 824503, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a thin slice there!  :-)  Fun title and nice find for a subject piece.  The blown highlights on the "ball" is going to cost you a tad probably.</td>', 'That''s a thin slice there!  :-)  Fun title and nice find for a subject piece.  The blown highlights on the "ball" is going to cost you a tad probably.', '2009-10-02 12:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671359, 824382, 30049, '<td valign="top">I had mixed feelings on scoring this.  Very little detail is available and that usually indicates a strong use of noise reduction (most likely not in this case).  I can tell you were using an extremely wide open aperture because just a smidge on the top rim is in focus.  However, I DO like the effect this creates in the lower areas of the photo with the OOF rings of the spring.  A very "artsy" type photo that is likely to have a polarizing vote result (either like it alot, or not like it much).  I think I ended up in the "liking" it camp.  :-)  Good luck!</td>', 'I had mixed feelings on scoring this.  Very little detail is available and that usually indicates a strong use of noise reduction (most likely not in this case).  I can tell you were using an extremely wide open aperture because just a smidge on the top rim is in focus.  However, I DO like the effect this creates in the lower areas of the photo with the OOF rings of the spring.  A very "artsy" type photo that is likely to have a polarizing vote result (either like it alot, or not like it much).  I think I ended up in the "liking" it camp.  :-)  Good luck!', '2009-10-02 12:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671360, 823980, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little bit snapshottish, but interesting nonetheless.  Can''t help but wonder what other angles and viewpoints were available that could have isolated the "loops" and gotten the trees out of the frame.</td>', 'A little bit snapshottish, but interesting nonetheless.  Can''t help but wonder what other angles and viewpoints were available that could have isolated the "loops" and gotten the trees out of the frame.', '2009-10-02 12:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671361, 824467, 30049, '<td valign="top">Bizzare!  Look like Flamingo heads.  :-)</td>', 'Bizzare!  Look like Flamingo heads.  :-)', '2009-10-02 12:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671363, 824321, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a fun looking tree and works ok for the challenge.  A tad bit mundane/static perhaps.</td>', 'That''s a fun looking tree and works ok for the challenge.  A tad bit mundane/static perhaps.', '2009-10-02 12:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671365, 824343, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fuzzy vines!  How cool is that?  :-)  I like the cool blue tones.</td>', 'Fuzzy vines!  How cool is that?  :-)  I like the cool blue tones.', '2009-10-02 12:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671528, 824715, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s one long-legged skinny spider!  :-)  As for the image, it''s fine overall.  It seems a tad oversharpened and I''d like to see less web to see more detail in the web strands.  All JMO of course.  Good luck!</td>', 'That''s one long-legged skinny spider!  :-)  As for the image, it''s fine overall.  It seems a tad oversharpened and I''d like to see less web to see more detail in the web strands.  All JMO of course.  Good luck!', '2009-10-02 13:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671530, 824650, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  Second slinky photo I''ve liked.  I like that is''s a B&amp;W thats converted very well, and I like the way you''ve snaked it out.  The interior border is a little wide for my taste, but not a big deal.  I''d voted on this earlier and gave it a 6...after looking longer while commenting I''ve decided to give this a slight bump up.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok.  Second slinky photo I''ve liked.  I like that is''s a B&W thats converted very well, and I like the way you''ve snaked it out.  The interior border is a little wide for my taste, but not a big deal.  I''d voted on this earlier and gave it a 6...after looking longer while commenting I''ve decided to give this a slight bump up.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 13:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
