(5671536, 824349, 109353, '<td valign="top">Crop isn''t allowed in basic editing ?</td>', 'Crop isn''t allowed in basic editing ?', '2009-10-02 13:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671537, 824719, 30049, '<td valign="top">Bizarre!  It would have been fun to watch you create this.  :-)</td>', 'Bizarre!  It would have been fun to watch you create this.  :-)', '2009-10-02 13:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671540, 824666, 30049, '<td valign="top">Trying to figure out what this is.  Perhaps a piece of shiny gold ribbon?  I like the twisted spiral.  Not too fond of the splotches of glitter that are bunched together.  Sets off well with the black bg.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Trying to figure out what this is.  Perhaps a piece of shiny gold ribbon?  I like the twisted spiral.  Not too fond of the splotches of glitter that are bunched together.  Sets off well with the black bg.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 13:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671541, 823699, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cool piece(s) of sculpture.  B&amp;W was the best choice...I think you''re trying to show too much here however.  Just getting one of those curls with the metal behind it would have been a way stronger presentation.  Too much other "stuff" going on in the background (light poles, hand rails, etc...).</td>', 'Very cool piece(s) of sculpture.  B&W was the best choice...I think you''re trying to show too much here however.  Just getting one of those curls with the metal behind it would have been a way stronger presentation.  Too much other "stuff" going on in the background (light poles, hand rails, etc...).', '2009-10-02 14:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671544, 824077, 30049, '<td valign="top">Simple and fairly interesting.</td>', 'Simple and fairly interesting.', '2009-10-02 14:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671546, 823708, 30049, '<td valign="top">Subject choice is ok.  Technicals (focus, exposure, etc...) are fine.  I''d probably lose the base and tighten it up some (lose a little of the negative space).  All JMO of course.  Good luck!</td>', 'Subject choice is ok.  Technicals (focus, exposure, etc...) are fine.  I''d probably lose the base and tighten it up some (lose a little of the negative space).  All JMO of course.  Good luck!', '2009-10-02 14:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671565, 824542, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...second time around on this one as I''m doing some commenting.  It''s growing on me a bit more.  I like how you''ve done a nice job controlling the lighting.  The subject certainly fits the challenge quite well and is pleasing to look at.  It does help to dust a little better.  ;-P  Good luck!</td>', 'Hmmm...second time around on this one as I''m doing some commenting.  It''s growing on me a bit more.  I like how you''ve done a nice job controlling the lighting.  The subject certainly fits the challenge quite well and is pleasing to look at.  It does help to dust a little better.  ;-P  Good luck!', '2009-10-02 14:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671569, 824654, 30049, '<td valign="top">The curved feathers add a LOT to this, rather than just the traditional curved neck.  Nice comp, good details, controlled exposure.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.</td>', 'The curved feathers add a LOT to this, rather than just the traditional curved neck.  Nice comp, good details, controlled exposure.  Should do ok with this one.  Good luck.', '2009-10-02 14:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671571, 824563, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun play with light.  I''ll be interested to read what method you used when the challenge is over.</td>', 'Fun play with light.  I''ll be interested to read what method you used when the challenge is over.', '2009-10-02 14:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671587, 824378, 30049, '<td valign="top">Drill bits were on my list of items to consider.  I hadn''t thought of putting them on a mirror.  That''s an interesting choice that works ok (be better if the mirror was clean - sorry, couldn''t resist).  Something about this still doesn''t present optimally I''m afraid.  Maybe with some space between the drill bits, or only three and have the variance in lenght a little more pronounced?  As is, they clump together somewhat.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Drill bits were on my list of items to consider.  I hadn''t thought of putting them on a mirror.  That''s an interesting choice that works ok (be better if the mirror was clean - sorry, couldn''t resist).  Something about this still doesn''t present optimally I''m afraid.  Maybe with some space between the drill bits, or only three and have the variance in lenght a little more pronounced?  As is, they clump together somewhat.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 14:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671594, 823232, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple concept, yet fun.  Should do just fine with this.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice, simple concept, yet fun.  Should do just fine with this.  Good luck!', '2009-10-02 14:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671603, 823904, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely staircase that certainly was worth photographing for this challenge.  One thing...I can''t help but be drawn to the door at the top of the stairs.  Kind of interrupts the flow and symmetry.  I have a suggestion for a slight mod in comp that I''ll share if you''re interested.  Overall, nicely seen.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely staircase that certainly was worth photographing for this challenge.  One thing...I can''t help but be drawn to the door at the top of the stairs.  Kind of interrupts the flow and symmetry.  I have a suggestion for a slight mod in comp that I''ll share if you''re interested.  Overall, nicely seen.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-02 14:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671612, 824617, 30049, '<td valign="top">I went back and forth on whether I liked this or not at first.  I have to say now that I DO like this entry.  At first it felt cluttered but now I can see that great length went into getting the correct spacing and flow in the combined pieces of this comp.  It does have a strong stock/studio feel to it that may turn off a few "artistic" types, but in the end this should do quite well I think.  Giving this a upward score adjustment at time of commenting.  Good luck.</td>', 'I went back and forth on whether I liked this or not at first.  I have to say now that I DO like this entry.  At first it felt cluttered but now I can see that great length went into getting the correct spacing and flow in the combined pieces of this comp.  It does have a strong stock/studio feel to it that may turn off a few "artistic" types, but in the end this should do quite well I think.  Giving this a upward score adjustment at time of commenting.  Good luck.', '2009-10-02 14:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671635, 824630, 30049, '<td valign="top">Colorful, a maybe a bit gimmicky.  Certainly stands out!  :-)  Good luck.</td>', 'Colorful, a maybe a bit gimmicky.  Certainly stands out!  :-)  Good luck.', '2009-10-02 14:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671638, 824409, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thing I notice is the color-matching letterbox border.  Kinda works for me...not sure that I wouldn''t have liked black better.  I like how you''ve centered this drill bit.  As far as the photography goes, this seems oversharpened, the highlights are blown, and the shadows are noisy (could be texture of the bg?).  I''m wavering.  You were either intentionally going for a high-key type look, or you''re covering up technical flaws with post-processing.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and say you were going for the artistic, unique approach.  :-)  Scored it earlier at a 6...still a 6 after commenting.  Good luck!</td>', 'First thing I notice is the color-matching letterbox border.  Kinda works for me...not sure that I wouldn''t have liked black better.  I like how you''ve centered this drill bit.  As far as the photography goes, this seems oversharpened, the highlights are blown, and the shadows are noisy (could be texture of the bg?).  I''m wavering.  You were either intentionally going for a high-key type look, or you''re covering up technical flaws with post-processing.  I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and say you were going for the artistic, unique approach.  :-)  Scored it earlier at a 6...still a 6 after commenting.  Good luck!', '2009-10-02 15:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671640, 824356, 30049, '<td valign="top">Look, it''s straws with holes!  :-D  I''ve never seen curlers (I think that''s what they are) in so many colors?  This is fun and should do ok for you.  Good luck!</td>', 'Look, it''s straws with holes!  :-D  I''ve never seen curlers (I think that''s what they are) in so many colors?  This is fun and should do ok for you.  Good luck!', '2009-10-02 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671642, 824646, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is certainly unique!</td>', 'This is certainly unique!', '2009-10-02 15:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5671643, 823806, 30049, '<td valign="top">The coolest thing about this photo?  The aperture shaped bokeh highlights.  :-)  The chain in the lower left is really the only thing that appears to be in focus and I think the medallion/pendant should be.</td>', 'The coolest thing about this photo?  The aperture shaped bokeh highlights.  :-)  The chain in the lower left is really the only thing that appears to be in focus and I think the medallion/pendant should be.', '2009-10-02 15:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
