(5672324, 824505, 83313, '<td valign="top">This shot is extremely flat looking. I thought it had a lot more in it however, so I copied it into paintshop pro and tried some common adjustments on it. After doing levels, curves, saturation and contrast, it really bumped this up a notch and brought out some nice detail and colors. As it stands, however, I''m afraid I have to give this a 4 for a good effort that has potential, but needs some more work. Sorry.</td>', 'This shot is extremely flat looking. I thought it had a lot more in it however, so I copied it into paintshop pro and tried some common adjustments on it. After doing levels, curves, saturation and contrast, it really bumped this up a notch and brought out some nice detail and colors. As it stands, however, I''m afraid I have to give this a 4 for a good effort that has potential, but needs some more work. Sorry.', '2009-10-03 00:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5672325, 824669, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll be looking for this one near the top.</td>', 'I''ll be looking for this one near the top.', '2009-10-03 00:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
