(5672428, 824584, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great location, but I think you were shooting in the photographically lousy midday sun, and the scene itself seems a bit busy and is really not guiding my eye through the image well. I''d love to see what else you had from this location.</td>', 'Great location, but I think you were shooting in the photographically lousy midday sun, and the scene itself seems a bit busy and is really not guiding my eye through the image well. I''d love to see what else you had from this location.', '2009-10-03 00:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
