(5673287, 824324, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun find and nicely captured.  May have been able to simplify this and only include a couple of the twisted leaves and picked up more detail and impact.  Just a thought.  Either way, good luck!</td>', 'This is a fun find and nicely captured.  May have been able to simplify this and only include a couple of the twisted leaves and picked up more detail and impact.  Just a thought.  Either way, good luck!', '2009-10-03 16:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673288, 824430, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve found straight lines that are warped &amp; twisted via reflection.  The double window helps with context.  I thought at first having just one window might be more interesting, but in the end your choice appears to be a sound decision.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like how you''ve found straight lines that are warped & twisted via reflection.  The double window helps with context.  I thought at first having just one window might be more interesting, but in the end your choice appears to be a sound decision.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-03 16:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673289, 824599, 110041, '<td valign="top">I''m no expert, but I think you''ve done well with the exposure on the mane, giving it an ethereal feel especially at the ends and the whispy loose hairs alon the neck.</td>', 'I''m no expert, but I think you''ve done well with the exposure on the mane, giving it an ethereal feel especially at the ends and the whispy loose hairs alon the neck.', '2009-10-03 16:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673290, 824274, 110041, '<td valign="top">Nice soft tones, but I''m not keen on the model''s expression (as pretty as she is).</td>', 'Nice soft tones, but I''m not keen on the model''s expression (as pretty as she is).', '2009-10-03 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673291, 823931, 30049, '<td valign="top">At first glance parts of this look like plaid cloth.  Very cool ribbons created with your light source.  Will be interested to see any comments on how you accomplished this after the challenge has finished.</td>', 'At first glance parts of this look like plaid cloth.  Very cool ribbons created with your light source.  Will be interested to see any comments on how you accomplished this after the challenge has finished.', '2009-10-03 16:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673294, 824668, 30049, '<td valign="top">"Ok".  Could be executed a little better.  That''s the first thing that comes to mind when I look at this.  The thumbnail looked intriquing.  The larger size is showing the dust &amp; debris on the background.  Thoughts, if you''re interested...use smooth poster board (it doesn''t look dirty/noisy), and maybe consider a lower angle.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', '"Ok".  Could be executed a little better.  That''s the first thing that comes to mind when I look at this.  The thumbnail looked intriquing.  The larger size is showing the dust & debris on the background.  Thoughts, if you''re interested...use smooth poster board (it doesn''t look dirty/noisy), and maybe consider a lower angle.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2009-10-03 16:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673296, 824584, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but a tad bit busy.  The lighting appears to be midday and a little harsh.  This location would probably have some popping textures with a low angle sun at dawn/dusk.  Just a thought.  :-)</td>', 'Interesting, but a tad bit busy.  The lighting appears to be midday and a little harsh.  This location would probably have some popping textures with a low angle sun at dawn/dusk.  Just a thought.  :-)', '2009-10-03 17:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673385, 824675, 109353, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good light, great use of DOF ... 10</td>', 'Nice composition, good light, great use of DOF ... 10', '2009-10-03 18:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673386, 824623, 109353, '<td valign="top">Nice, very creative ... 10</td>', 'Nice, very creative ... 10', '2009-10-03 18:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673387, 824080, 109353, '<td valign="top">I love it ... nothing else to say : 10</td>', 'I love it ... nothing else to say : 10', '2009-10-03 18:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673603, 824318, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really like the shot, but the reflection is quite distracting. Did you try a polarizer?</td>', 'I really like the shot, but the reflection is quite distracting. Did you try a polarizer?', '2009-10-03 21:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673606, 824467, 15511, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and color.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and color.', '2009-10-03 21:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673620, 824156, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this shot so much, but really, the lines aren''t really curved or twisted. It fits the title, but I can''t see that it fits the description... but I like it so much, I can''t mark it too low.</td>', 'I like this shot so much, but really, the lines aren''t really curved or twisted. It fits the title, but I can''t see that it fits the description... but I like it so much, I can''t mark it too low.', '2009-10-03 22:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673621, 824503, 103142, '<td valign="top">This was slightly interesting at first glance. A little more interesting a second later. And then I thought "this is really cool! I like it!" I hope people look at this for more than a second, or you might be in trouble.  8</td>', 'This was slightly interesting at first glance. A little more interesting a second later. And then I thought "this is really cool! I like it!" I hope people look at this for more than a second, or you might be in trouble.  8', '2009-10-03 22:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673622, 824065, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute idea, but you really should have curved or twisted the lines. It just barely scrapes by meeting the definition of the challenge. (not voting yet)</td>', 'It''s a cute idea, but you really should have curved or twisted the lines. It just barely scrapes by meeting the definition of the challenge. (not voting yet)', '2009-10-03 22:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5673655, 824080, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellente whites. Lovely twists and turns. 8</td>', 'Excellente whites. Lovely twists and turns. 8', '2009-10-03 22:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674011, 824623, 58272, '<td valign="top">I admire your incredible creativity!!!!!!!!! Wow. Also nicely composed and lit.</td>', 'I admire your incredible creativity!!!!!!!!! Wow. Also nicely composed and lit.', '2009-10-04 07:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674012, 824175, 58272, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully balanced.. the blue tones also add to the atmosphere</td>', 'This is wonderfully balanced.. the blue tones also add to the atmosphere', '2009-10-04 07:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674056, 824533, 5746, '<td valign="top">The fact that it''s out of focus makes it look like a white rose. Interesting effect - I wonder whether it was intentional. The white however looks grayish a bit and at least the center could be in focus.</td>', 'The fact that it''s out of focus makes it look like a white rose. Interesting effect - I wonder whether it was intentional. The white however looks grayish a bit and at least the center could be in focus.', '2009-10-04 08:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674059, 823980, 5746, '<td valign="top">What a pity the sky was so cloudy. Good subject which could make an interesting effect on a blue sky. maybe reduced exposition could help?</td>', 'What a pity the sky was so cloudy. Good subject which could make an interesting effect on a blue sky. maybe reduced exposition could help?', '2009-10-04 09:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674065, 824542, 5746, '<td valign="top">The dust or small spider web remains are a bit distracting, but it''s just me being picky :) Nice contrast and colour. Nice subject. The background is really black, which makes the bamboo pop. Nice diagonal composition. The focus is a bit soft, but it may be my eyes as well :)</td>', 'The dust or small spider web remains are a bit distracting, but it''s just me being picky :) Nice contrast and colour. Nice subject. The background is really black, which makes the bamboo pop. Nice diagonal composition. The focus is a bit soft, but it may be my eyes as well :)', '2009-10-04 09:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674067, 824143, 5746, '<td valign="top">Not many twisted lines. I guess you were after the stream, but the trees are more prominent in this picture. Beautiful models - including horse :) Good luck!</td>', 'Not many twisted lines. I guess you were after the stream, but the trees are more prominent in this picture. Beautiful models - including horse :) Good luck!', '2009-10-04 09:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674072, 824409, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice high key image. I like this whatever it is. The border is a bit too prominent for my liking.</td>', 'Nice high key image. I like this whatever it is. The border is a bit too prominent for my liking.', '2009-10-04 09:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674076, 824654, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird and beautiful pose. It is difficult to catch the subtle tones. I guess the light was a bit too strong and some details on its neck are lost, or maybe you intentionally focused on the wings? Very DMC. The tight crop was good choice. Good luck :)</td>', 'Beautiful bird and beautiful pose. It is difficult to catch the subtle tones. I guess the light was a bit too strong and some details on its neck are lost, or maybe you intentionally focused on the wings? Very DMC. The tight crop was good choice. Good luck :)', '2009-10-04 09:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674078, 824519, 5746, '<td valign="top">Beautiful morning indeed. I like the colour scheme.  Good luck :)</td>', 'Beautiful morning indeed. I like the colour scheme.  Good luck :)', '2009-10-04 09:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674081, 823906, 5746, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh I think. Good idea. I like the egg cup :)</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh I think. Good idea. I like the egg cup :)', '2009-10-04 09:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674082, 824083, 5746, '<td valign="top">I hate this kind of games - they always make me feel stupid :) When it comes to the picture: if not the name I wouldn''t guess what is it. The colour scheme is nice. Nice reflecting background. Good light. Good focus. Maybe different angle would make this composition more appealing (a bit to the top or so). Good luck :)</td>', 'I hate this kind of games - they always make me feel stupid :) When it comes to the picture: if not the name I wouldn''t guess what is it. The colour scheme is nice. Nice reflecting background. Good light. Good focus. Maybe different angle would make this composition more appealing (a bit to the top or so). Good luck :)', '2009-10-04 09:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674086, 824366, 5746, '<td valign="top">I have problem with this picture - The view is amazing. The rocks structure is very interesting. The colours are appealing. It''s very DMC. I don''t know - maybe there is too much contrast? In the shadows the details are lost. But the scenery is breathtaking. I wonder where did you take it. Good luck :)</td>', 'I have problem with this picture - The view is amazing. The rocks structure is very interesting. The colours are appealing. It''s very DMC. I don''t know - maybe there is too much contrast? In the shadows the details are lost. But the scenery is breathtaking. I wonder where did you take it. Good luck :)', '2009-10-04 09:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674087, 823751, 5746, '<td valign="top">Cramped background is a bit distracting. Tomatoes give nice contrast. The fork looks a bit flat. Maybe deepr DOF would be better.</td>', 'Cramped background is a bit distracting. Tomatoes give nice contrast. The fork looks a bit flat. Maybe deepr DOF would be better.', '2009-10-04 09:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674090, 823657, 5746, '<td valign="top">No idea what is it. I like the abstract feel but there is something missing in the overall composition. No focus point I guess.</td>', 'No idea what is it. I like the abstract feel but there is something missing in the overall composition. No focus point I guess.', '2009-10-04 09:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674092, 824529, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like the twisted grass as well :) Nice colours and good DOF. The most important details are in focus.I would move the composition a bit to the left to enhance the "guardian".  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the twisted grass as well :) Nice colours and good DOF. The most important details are in focus.I would move the composition a bit to the left to enhance the "guardian".  Good luck.', '2009-10-04 09:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674093, 824713, 5746, '<td valign="top">It is not easy to make portraits of people in hats. I don''t know whether you used anything to lighten her face - something reflecting light to get rid of shadows under her eyes. Good idea, nevertheless :)</td>', 'It is not easy to make portraits of people in hats. I don''t know whether you used anything to lighten her face - something reflecting light to get rid of shadows under her eyes. Good idea, nevertheless :)', '2009-10-04 09:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674094, 824274, 5746, '<td valign="top">With people I prefer to have focus on their eyes. The picture of the wire and her mouth alone would''ve been interesting as well :)</td>', 'With people I prefer to have focus on their eyes. The picture of the wire and her mouth alone would''ve been interesting as well :)', '2009-10-04 09:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5674095, 824655, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great colours and detail. I like the composition. Good luck :)</td>', 'Great colours and detail. I like the composition. Good luck :)', '2009-10-04 09:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
