(5674609, 824373, 83313, '<td valign="top">Kind of an odd looking treatment but I like it. Not sure if that look is a lighting effect, or from a post processing adjustment.</td>', 'Kind of an odd looking treatment but I like it. Not sure if that look is a lighting effect, or from a post processing adjustment.', '2009-10-04 18:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
