(5675778, 823821, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very abstract with interesting OOF highlights.  Not really seeing this as a defined twisted or curved lines that is appealing (to me).  If the challenge was ''Water'' or ''Splash'' then I could buy into it.  Sorry.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very abstract with interesting OOF highlights.  Not really seeing this as a defined twisted or curved lines that is appealing (to me).  If the challenge was ''Water'' or ''Splash'' then I could buy into it.  Sorry.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-05 16:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675784, 823850, 30049, '<td valign="top">Some potential here.  The primary object is worthy of consideration.  Seeing the vase at the bottom doesn''t help this photo IMO.  The bg is a bit too neutral also for this subject (again IMO).  The twisted pieces in the center of this arrangement would make a good close study.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Some potential here.  The primary object is worthy of consideration.  Seeing the vase at the bottom doesn''t help this photo IMO.  The bg is a bit too neutral also for this subject (again IMO).  The twisted pieces in the center of this arrangement would make a good close study.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2009-10-05 16:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675792, 823351, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummm...not sure what I''m looking at here, but I have to say it''s not really that appealing to me.  Seems that the technicals for this photo are ok.  Maybe if I knew what the object/subject is I could grab a different perspective on this.</td>', 'Ummm...not sure what I''m looking at here, but I have to say it''s not really that appealing to me.  Seems that the technicals for this photo are ok.  Maybe if I knew what the object/subject is I could grab a different perspective on this.', '2009-10-05 16:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675801, 824531, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, at first I wouldn''t have considered this fence as ''Twisted'' or curved, but that''s pretty much the way it''s made.  :-)  Did you consider rotating this 180 to the left?  Then you''d have the lines of the fence going more naturally from left to right.  The busy bg isn''t helping the presentation here either IMO.  A shallower DOF could have been your friend here.  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s funny, at first I wouldn''t have considered this fence as ''Twisted'' or curved, but that''s pretty much the way it''s made.  :-)  Did you consider rotating this 180 to the left?  Then you''d have the lines of the fence going more naturally from left to right.  The busy bg isn''t helping the presentation here either IMO.  A shallower DOF could have been your friend here.  Anyway...good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-05 16:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675810, 824443, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the swirly lines for sure.  Not sure about what the sand is bringing to this - I understand that sand and driftwood come together, just that the sand...oh heck, nevermind about the sand.  I''m nitpicking.  :-)  I think what is holding this back for me overall is the lighting.  Seems a bit flat.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the swirly lines for sure.  Not sure about what the sand is bringing to this - I understand that sand and driftwood come together, just that the sand...oh heck, nevermind about the sand.  I''m nitpicking.  :-)  I think what is holding this back for me overall is the lighting.  Seems a bit flat.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-05 16:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675817, 824422, 30049, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to do smoke like this it has to be perfect to score well here anymore.  That''s because, like waterdrops, it''s been done over and over again.  I can see where you were headed with this photo and it makes sense overall for this challenge.  However, a good portion of the smoke is (or seems to be for me) a little OOF.  The sharpest area of the smoke is the lower-left.  The upper-right is losing that crispness.  Really need to ''freeze'' the action to keep it all sharp.  Good luck.</td>', 'If you''re going to do smoke like this it has to be perfect to score well here anymore.  That''s because, like waterdrops, it''s been done over and over again.  I can see where you were headed with this photo and it makes sense overall for this challenge.  However, a good portion of the smoke is (or seems to be for me) a little OOF.  The sharpest area of the smoke is the lower-left.  The upper-right is losing that crispness.  Really need to ''freeze'' the action to keep it all sharp.  Good luck.', '2009-10-05 16:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675882, 824237, 99086, '<td valign="top">good pic, but theme?</td>', 'good pic, but theme?', '2009-10-05 17:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675939, 824168, 36035, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of watermellon.</td>', 'Excellent use of watermellon.', '2009-10-05 18:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675941, 824503, 36035, '<td valign="top">Depth of field is a little distracting.</td>', 'Depth of field is a little distracting.', '2009-10-05 18:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5675957, 824485, 36035, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1099/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_824485.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1099/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_824485.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1099/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_824485.jpg"/></td>', '', '2009-10-05 18:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676090, 824623, 3102, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your ribbon!  Ok, technically the voting hasn''t ended yet, but I''m willing to bet we''ll see this on the front page soon :)</td>', 'Congratulations on your ribbon!  Ok, technically the voting hasn''t ended yet, but I''m willing to bet we''ll see this on the front page soon :)', '2009-10-05 20:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676117, 824682, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the wild brushy trees, pretty cool.  Not sure if they have enough impact to lift your score above the average mark in this challenge.  Lighting seems a bit on the harsh side (like mid-day sun) and I''m seeing some purple fringing in the bare tree tops.</td>', 'I like the wild brushy trees, pretty cool.  Not sure if they have enough impact to lift your score above the average mark in this challenge.  Lighting seems a bit on the harsh side (like mid-day sun) and I''m seeing some purple fringing in the bare tree tops.', '2009-10-05 20:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676122, 824347, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice complimentary colors.  I have to say the blue is a bit of a shock...don''t know why exactly.  Guess I associate rusty barbed wire with more earthy tones. Does make this unique.  :-) Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice complimentary colors.  I have to say the blue is a bit of a shock...don''t know why exactly.  Guess I associate rusty barbed wire with more earthy tones. Does make this unique.  :-) Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-05 20:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676123, 824282, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower.  You''ve captured it in a manner that shows it well.  Somewhat static; I think the centered comp is contributing to that.</td>', 'Beautiful flower.  You''ve captured it in a manner that shows it well.  Somewhat static; I think the centered comp is contributing to that.', '2009-10-05 20:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676125, 823289, 30049, '<td valign="top">Heh!  They look like worms!  Very unique for sure.  As a photo for the challenge it fits fine, although the comp is somewhat centered and busy.  This would be a great subject for some closeup work.</td>', 'Heh!  They look like worms!  Very unique for sure.  As a photo for the challenge it fits fine, although the comp is somewhat centered and busy.  This would be a great subject for some closeup work.', '2009-10-05 20:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676126, 823729, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clear, clever, and ready for the stock portfolio.  Giving this a nudge on this second pass thru.  Good luck!</td>', 'Clear, clever, and ready for the stock portfolio.  Giving this a nudge on this second pass thru.  Good luck!', '2009-10-05 20:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676131, 823738, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''m glad I''m coming back around for a second look while commenting.  I think I scored this too low the first time around (5).  Lovely circles of light and the detail in the vine is great.  The one and only thing keeping this from reaching the very top of the scoring scale is the POV you took that included the larger piece of vine/wood on the left.  Maybe you couldn''t have moved (I hate when someone tells me I should have moved.  He-he) - but I sure as heck would have tried to find a view that isolated what you have in the center.  Anyway...nice eye to see this.  Good luck in the challenge - I hope the score bump helps.</td>', 'Wow.  I''m glad I''m coming back around for a second look while commenting.  I think I scored this too low the first time around (5).  Lovely circles of light and the detail in the vine is great.  The one and only thing keeping this from reaching the very top of the scoring scale is the POV you took that included the larger piece of vine/wood on the left.  Maybe you couldn''t have moved (I hate when someone tells me I should have moved.  He-he) - but I sure as heck would have tried to find a view that isolated what you have in the center.  Anyway...nice eye to see this.  Good luck in the challenge - I hope the score bump helps.', '2009-10-05 20:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676132, 824463, 30049, '<td valign="top">If the whole comp could have looked like the top and middle-back areas this would really jump out for me.  I''m not really liking the large areas of blurred light.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'If the whole comp could have looked like the top and middle-back areas this would really jump out for me.  I''m not really liking the large areas of blurred light.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-05 20:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676181, 824653, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve paired the "barbs" and their placement in the comp is good.  Good separation of subject from background.  Overall this photo is coming off very flat and the grey/grey is, well, very grey!  :-|  All JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like how you''ve paired the "barbs" and their placement in the comp is good.  Good separation of subject from background.  Overall this photo is coming off very flat and the grey/grey is, well, very grey!  :-|  All JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2009-10-05 21:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676183, 823871, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cliche-ish (sp?), and very sharp.  Should find this one near the top when all is said and done.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very cliche-ish (sp?), and very sharp.  Should find this one near the top when all is said and done.  Good luck!', '2009-10-05 21:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676185, 824259, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked, and looked...I WANT to like this as it''s unique and I like that you found something different.  The shadow is fun although I wonder if there wasn''t more here with a little tighter presentation of the ''spiral'' and it''s shadow.</td>', 'I''ve looked, and looked...I WANT to like this as it''s unique and I like that you found something different.  The shadow is fun although I wonder if there wasn''t more here with a little tighter presentation of the ''spiral'' and it''s shadow.', '2009-10-05 21:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676186, 824448, 30049, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach...  Feeling some friction and slight repulsion to having a bug in my serving dish.  :-)  Actually, I''m half serious on that point.  I like your choice of ''curves''.  A bit noisy in the shadows.</td>', 'An interesting approach...  Feeling some friction and slight repulsion to having a bug in my serving dish.  :-)  Actually, I''m half serious on that point.  I like your choice of ''curves''.  A bit noisy in the shadows.', '2009-10-05 21:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676510, 824020, 30049, '<td valign="top">Overall, I like the concept with the white "litter" and the red straw.  I take it the red straw is your primary ''Twisted'' or curved line?  One minor nitpik is the straw is a strong leading line that takes the viewer nearly out of the frame instead of into it.</td>', 'Overall, I like the concept with the white "litter" and the red straw.  I take it the red straw is your primary ''Twisted'' or curved line?  One minor nitpik is the straw is a strong leading line that takes the viewer nearly out of the frame instead of into it.', '2009-10-06 08:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676511, 824713, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had fun with this.  :-)  Did you happen to get any shots with a smile?  I''d be curious how that worked out.</td>', 'Looks like you had fun with this.  :-)  Did you happen to get any shots with a smile?  I''d be curious how that worked out.', '2009-10-06 08:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676513, 823845, 30049, '<td valign="top">Rubber bands?  This photo is growing on me a little seeing it on the second look while commenting.  I like the texture and that you''ve kept the arrangement of items strategically placed, but not strictly uniform.  Only nit from me is I wish the 3 bands in front (starting with red/white and going left) were all crisply focused, then let the back ones fade out.  Lighting on the top could be just a tad strong.  Good luck in the challenge.  Small bump in score after second look.</td>', 'Rubber bands?  This photo is growing on me a little seeing it on the second look while commenting.  I like the texture and that you''ve kept the arrangement of items strategically placed, but not strictly uniform.  Only nit from me is I wish the 3 bands in front (starting with red/white and going left) were all crisply focused, then let the back ones fade out.  Lighting on the top could be just a tad strong.  Good luck in the challenge.  Small bump in score after second look.', '2009-10-06 08:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676516, 824662, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.  Glad you said in the title what this is as it helped to speed up the recognition.  This is a fun (and presuming natural) black and white image.  Actually, now that I''ve looked at it a second time  while commenting I''m kinding of liking it a whole lot more than the first time.  Substantial bump up in score.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.  Glad you said in the title what this is as it helped to speed up the recognition.  This is a fun (and presuming natural) black and white image.  Actually, now that I''ve looked at it a second time  while commenting I''m kinding of liking it a whole lot more than the first time.  Substantial bump up in score.  Good luck!', '2009-10-06 08:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676518, 824565, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, a twisty it is.  I think the narrow DOF would work better without the extra negative space.</td>', 'Yep, a twisty it is.  I think the narrow DOF would work better without the extra negative space.', '2009-10-06 08:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676520, 824624, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a fun thing to play with.  :-)  I like black/blue color combos.  Blue can be tricky as it''s usually one of the noisiest color channels, and this time is no exception.</td>', 'This looks like a fun thing to play with.  :-)  I like black/blue color combos.  Blue can be tricky as it''s usually one of the noisiest color channels, and this time is no exception.', '2009-10-06 08:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676521, 824532, 30049, '<td valign="top">Rowie is a great abstract artist in the making.  :-)  I like what you''ve chosen to include with the overall comp.  Interesting, yet not too cluttered.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Rowie is a great abstract artist in the making.  :-)  I like what you''ve chosen to include with the overall comp.  Interesting, yet not too cluttered.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 08:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676524, 823952, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m finding the reflections to be quite intriquing.  Did your arms get tired holding that light out there like that?  And...do you always shoot without a shirt on?  :-P</td>', 'I''m finding the reflections to be quite intriquing.  Did your arms get tired holding that light out there like that?  And...do you always shoot without a shirt on?  :-P', '2009-10-06 08:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676525, 824342, 30049, '<td valign="top">He-he.  Pulling out all the stops on this one, eh?  Nice bg bokeh circles of light and the cliche book pages...  Darn it.  I actually like it!  Hmmmph.  I''m glad I took a second look while coming around to comment.  End result is a nice bump in score.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'He-he.  Pulling out all the stops on this one, eh?  Nice bg bokeh circles of light and the cliche book pages...  Darn it.  I actually like it!  Hmmmph.  I''m glad I took a second look while coming around to comment.  End result is a nice bump in score.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 09:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676526, 824720, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok.  What''s going on with all the rope light shots lately?  Did I miss a special blowout sale on these somewhere?  :-)  This is fine overall, but seems (like many others with this material) that it''s hard to get sharp patterns...end up with more blurred than not.  JMO of course.  Good luck!</td>', 'Ok.  What''s going on with all the rope light shots lately?  Did I miss a special blowout sale on these somewhere?  :-)  This is fine overall, but seems (like many others with this material) that it''s hard to get sharp patterns...end up with more blurred than not.  JMO of course.  Good luck!', '2009-10-06 09:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676532, 823751, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice presentation overall.  Good touch with the greens.  Lighting in the bg is a little hot (lower left), the sheet is substantially wrinkled, and something about the fork seems bland (like it''s not clean and sparkly).  Not trying to be harsh, however, when you have time to setup a "studio" type shot, the details can make or break the final outcome.  All JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice presentation overall.  Good touch with the greens.  Lighting in the bg is a little hot (lower left), the sheet is substantially wrinkled, and something about the fork seems bland (like it''s not clean and sparkly).  Not trying to be harsh, however, when you have time to setup a "studio" type shot, the details can make or break the final outcome.  All JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 09:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676534, 824323, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok".  Nice landscape scene...not great, or breathtaking, but pleasing nonetheless.  You have left some sizing on the table (max is 640 pixels) when you only used 600, and your border is lopsided.  Just some observations.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s "ok".  Nice landscape scene...not great, or breathtaking, but pleasing nonetheless.  You have left some sizing on the table (max is 640 pixels) when you only used 600, and your border is lopsided.  Just some observations.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 09:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676536, 824091, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep, and it''s not pretty at home either.  :-)  You''ve certainly met the challenge theme of twisted / curved lines, but quite honestly, the photo is underwhelming from a viewing standpoint.  Also, why not use the full 640 pixels?  You only used 500 on the long side.</td>', 'Yep, and it''s not pretty at home either.  :-)  You''ve certainly met the challenge theme of twisted / curved lines, but quite honestly, the photo is underwhelming from a viewing standpoint.  Also, why not use the full 640 pixels?  You only used 500 on the long side.', '2009-10-06 09:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676537, 824529, 30049, '<td valign="top">This looks like a spot to come back to for sure.  I love old fence posts such as this one.  The OOF building in the bg is a perfect compliment.  What kept this average vs outstanding for me is that the wires start fading on the off-center right of the post and all the way over to the remaining right.  If you could have kept all wires sharp, at least on the post, this would present much stronger IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like a spot to come back to for sure.  I love old fence posts such as this one.  The OOF building in the bg is a perfect compliment.  What kept this average vs outstanding for me is that the wires start fading on the off-center right of the post and all the way over to the remaining right.  If you could have kept all wires sharp, at least on the post, this would present much stronger IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 09:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676538, 824540, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great control of lighting and focus on this.  A bit mundane subject-wise IMO.  I think the fading paint actually takes away from this somewhat.</td>', 'Great control of lighting and focus on this.  A bit mundane subject-wise IMO.  I think the fading paint actually takes away from this somewhat.', '2009-10-06 09:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676539, 824686, 30049, '<td valign="top">First thought on this?  What''s the smear/nick/mark on the front center white area?  Then I see sensor spots that could have been cleaned in post-processing.  So, out the gate, I''m leaning on the downside.  That sets me up for seeing the downfalls rather than the positives as I continue to take in your photo.  Other observations that will help for your next entry are to use a lower ISO to control the noise, and diffuse the lighting to eliminate harsh glare.<br/> <br/>The point I''m trying to make is that first impressions are important, and attention to details will improve the viewers first look and impact opinions.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'First thought on this?  What''s the smear/nick/mark on the front center white area?  Then I see sensor spots that could have been cleaned in post-processing.  So, out the gate, I''m leaning on the downside.  That sets me up for seeing the downfalls rather than the positives as I continue to take in your photo.  Other observations that will help for your next entry are to use a lower ISO to control the noise, and diffuse the lighting to eliminate harsh glare. The point I''m trying to make is that first impressions are important, and attention to details will improve the viewers first look and impact opinions. All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2009-10-06 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676544, 824543, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and color tones.  Subject matter is "ok".</td>', 'I like the lighting and color tones.  Subject matter is "ok".', '2009-10-06 09:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676545, 824702, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like eggs.  Nice use of lighting.  Wish the bg was all black.  As is, it looks like it''s dusty.</td>', 'Looks like eggs.  Nice use of lighting.  Wish the bg was all black.  As is, it looks like it''s dusty.', '2009-10-06 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676546, 824473, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice twist find and I like the isolation of it in your presentation.  The overcast grey skies are detrimental.  Did you consider pushing this to a highkey or maybe going black &amp; white instead?</td>', 'Nice twist find and I like the isolation of it in your presentation.  The overcast grey skies are detrimental.  Did you consider pushing this to a highkey or maybe going black & white instead?', '2009-10-06 09:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676547, 824485, 30049, '<td valign="top">Didn''t quite get it square, eh?  Have to give you a hard time as I imagine you spent a good deal of effort in lining everything up.  :-)  I like the materials you used, especially the rope and square (is that cork board?).  The red is splotchy...maybe black would have worked better?  Just and thought.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Didn''t quite get it square, eh?  Have to give you a hard time as I imagine you spent a good deal of effort in lining everything up.  :-)  I like the materials you used, especially the rope and square (is that cork board?).  The red is splotchy...maybe black would have worked better?  Just and thought.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 09:37:08.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5676548, 824272, 30049, '<td valign="top">Potential here.  Missed getting full benefit of the details in the threads from two things: focus point and lighting.  The bg wall is distracting.  Just a few thoughts from me...  Good luck!</td>', 'Potential here.  Missed getting full benefit of the details in the threads from two things: focus point and lighting.  The bg wall is distracting.  Just a few thoughts from me...  Good luck!', '2009-10-06 09:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676549, 824603, 30049, '<td valign="top">So much to look at, and nowhere to land.  Get the feeling I''m looking up at this.  Not sure if that''s good or bad - just an observation.</td>', 'So much to look at, and nowhere to land.  Get the feeling I''m looking up at this.  Not sure if that''s good or bad - just an observation.', '2009-10-06 09:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676550, 824373, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good idea and you''ve captured good detail.  Biggest thing holding this back is the lack of contrast IMO.</td>', 'Good idea and you''ve captured good detail.  Biggest thing holding this back is the lack of contrast IMO.', '2009-10-06 09:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676553, 824381, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good subject material to work with.  You''re not quite getting the impact/crispness of the water that I think you intended.  Lighting is a little flat and the sharpness isn''t quite there.</td>', 'Good subject material to work with.  You''re not quite getting the impact/crispness of the water that I think you intended.  Lighting is a little flat and the sharpness isn''t quite there.', '2009-10-06 09:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676554, 823246, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the idea overall...the light source could have been different/better IMO.</td>', 'I like the idea overall...the light source could have been different/better IMO.', '2009-10-06 09:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676555, 824629, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice B/W conversion.  Good detail and focus for two objects at this distance from each other.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice B/W conversion.  Good detail and focus for two objects at this distance from each other.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 09:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676556, 824573, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a fun reflection.  I like it, but it doesn''t seem balanced.  Just an observation.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a fun reflection.  I like it, but it doesn''t seem balanced.  Just an observation.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676558, 823856, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good use of lighting on this often visited subject material.  Like the vignette that the lighting creates.</td>', 'Good use of lighting on this often visited subject material.  Like the vignette that the lighting creates.', '2009-10-06 09:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676559, 824098, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cool building for sure!  A bit tighter on the curved area by either moving your POV or zooming in a tad (eliminate flag and lower railing) would enhance the presentation IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool building for sure!  A bit tighter on the curved area by either moving your POV or zooming in a tad (eliminate flag and lower railing) would enhance the presentation IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676562, 824322, 30049, '<td valign="top">He knows you''re there!  Look at those ears.  :-)  The horns are a fine subject for this challenge.  The brush is severly competing for attention.</td>', 'He knows you''re there!  Look at those ears.  :-)  The horns are a fine subject for this challenge.  The brush is severly competing for attention.', '2009-10-06 09:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676563, 824718, 30049, '<td valign="top">Have no idea what this is so I guess that makes it a fun abstract then, eh?  :-)  Yes, there are curves.  Not seeing much that''s in focus however.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Have no idea what this is so I guess that makes it a fun abstract then, eh?  :-)  Yes, there are curves.  Not seeing much that''s in focus however.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 09:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676564, 824632, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Twisted, and out-of-line.  :-)  Nothing personal, but the subject is a little bit mundane.  Photographed well however.</td>', 'Yep.  Twisted, and out-of-line.  :-)  Nothing personal, but the subject is a little bit mundane.  Photographed well however.', '2009-10-06 09:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676565, 824366, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sure looks dry from the air doesn''t it!  I find the small inlets and the trails they''ve left, one of the more interesting features of this image.</td>', 'Sure looks dry from the air doesn''t it!  I find the small inlets and the trails they''ve left, one of the more interesting features of this image.', '2009-10-06 09:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676567, 823851, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun abstract and a neat find.</td>', 'Fun abstract and a neat find.', '2009-10-06 09:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676572, 824635, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice control and aperture choice for the isolating DOF.  This is going to sound weird, but the twisty looks plastic and seems out of place on the wood.  A paper twisty would have some detail with the paper fiber, etc...  Told you it was weird.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice control and aperture choice for the isolating DOF.  This is going to sound weird, but the twisty looks plastic and seems out of place on the wood.  A paper twisty would have some detail with the paper fiber, etc...  Told you it was weird.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 09:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676573, 824156, 30049, '<td valign="top">Seems more angled than twisted.  Where did you find a stack of books like this?!</td>', 'Seems more angled than twisted.  Where did you find a stack of books like this?!', '2009-10-06 09:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676575, 823674, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised we didn''t see more corkscrews in this challenge.  This item is so smooth it''s hard to show that you''ve gotten sharp focus.  It''s also blending into the black a little too much and becoming lost.  All JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m surprised we didn''t see more corkscrews in this challenge.  This item is so smooth it''s hard to show that you''ve gotten sharp focus.  It''s also blending into the black a little too much and becoming lost.  All JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 09:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676576, 824669, 30049, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a fine setup.</td>', 'Congratulations on a fine setup.', '2009-10-06 10:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676579, 824386, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a whole lot of angle iron!  Wouldn''t this be a fun place to get in close with a camera?!  I''m sure that it''s off-limits to non-employees, but still...  Nice find.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a whole lot of angle iron!  Wouldn''t this be a fun place to get in close with a camera?!  I''m sure that it''s off-limits to non-employees, but still...  Nice find.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 10:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676580, 824318, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun!  As a challenge entry the interest level for the subject material is medium at best (for me anyway).  Hard one for me to comment on.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Fun!  As a challenge entry the interest level for the subject material is medium at best (for me anyway).  Hard one for me to comment on.  Sorry.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 10:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676582, 824175, 30049, '<td valign="top">A fun exercise in painting with light for sure.  Something about it''s not quite there on the fine presentation level for me, and I''m sorry but can''t really put a finger on it.  Maybe it''s the textured material that the book is on, or it could be the width of the light trails (they seem kind of wide).  It''s just not crisp and making me go "Wow".  Nonetheless, I wish you good luck.</td>', 'A fun exercise in painting with light for sure.  Something about it''s not quite there on the fine presentation level for me, and I''m sorry but can''t really put a finger on it.  Maybe it''s the textured material that the book is on, or it could be the width of the light trails (they seem kind of wide).  It''s just not crisp and making me go "Wow".  Nonetheless, I wish you good luck.', '2009-10-06 10:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676584, 824623, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Something about her expression reminds me of "I Love Lucy!".  :-P</td>', 'Cute!  Something about her expression reminds me of "I Love Lucy!".  :-P', '2009-10-06 10:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676586, 824349, 110683, '<td valign="top">crop it</td>', 'crop it', '2009-10-06 10:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676587, 824642, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful vista you have here.  A tad thin on challenge connection.  I guess technically, yes, it fits.  On technical points the composition is off a tad; the horizon is tilted, and the brush in the lower-left would be better left out of the frame.  JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a wonderful vista you have here.  A tad thin on challenge connection.  I guess technically, yes, it fits.  On technical points the composition is off a tad; the horizon is tilted, and the brush in the lower-left would be better left out of the frame.  JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 10:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676590, 824518, 30049, '<td valign="top">Bit tired of smoke shots personally (that''s what comes with being here too long I guess), but you''ve done a nice job of capturing good sharp curls.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Bit tired of smoke shots personally (that''s what comes with being here too long I guess), but you''ve done a nice job of capturing good sharp curls.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 10:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676594, 824533, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the feeling of softness here for sure.  The curls work for the challenge.  Not sure about the off-white greyish look to this.  May have been your intention but it seems like this needs a good tweak with levels.</td>', 'You''ve captured the feeling of softness here for sure.  The curls work for the challenge.  Not sure about the off-white greyish look to this.  May have been your intention but it seems like this needs a good tweak with levels.', '2009-10-06 10:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676595, 824348, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a fun piece of art!  Could possibly use a small boost in contrast on this.  Also...have you considered using a circular polarizer?  It would control some of the highlight glare you''re getting on this.  Just some observations.  Good luck!</td>', 'That''s a fun piece of art!  Could possibly use a small boost in contrast on this.  Also...have you considered using a circular polarizer?  It would control some of the highlight glare you''re getting on this.  Just some observations.  Good luck!', '2009-10-06 10:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676597, 824687, 30049, '<td valign="top">Low view of a water fountain?  If you let your mind wander the metal almost looks like a person bent over in deep thought or sleep.  Personally, I like that you''ve let the bg highlights go.  Brave.   Not DPC friendly usually.  :-)  Good luck!</td>', 'Low view of a water fountain?  If you let your mind wander the metal almost looks like a person bent over in deep thought or sleep.  Personally, I like that you''ve let the bg highlights go.  Brave.   Not DPC friendly usually.  :-)  Good luck!', '2009-10-06 10:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676599, 824349, 30049, '<td valign="top">Fun snapshot.  Actually, with a different crop, this could gain a point in voting I think.  Good luck.</td>', 'Fun snapshot.  Actually, with a different crop, this could gain a point in voting I think.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676601, 824569, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh boy.  Sorry, but I''m not finding this very appealing.  I can appreciate a good blur, light trail shot in an abstract presentation, but this just appears chaotic.</td>', 'Oh boy.  Sorry, but I''m not finding this very appealing.  I can appreciate a good blur, light trail shot in an abstract presentation, but this just appears chaotic.', '2009-10-06 10:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676606, 823906, 30049, '<td valign="top">A fine attempt at a documentary type of photo.  May need some adjustments with levels, a diffused light source, and a truer white bg, to lift this up.</td>', 'A fine attempt at a documentary type of photo.  May need some adjustments with levels, a diffused light source, and a truer white bg, to lift this up.', '2009-10-06 10:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676607, 824502, 30049, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like ice cream.  Could be the smoothness of the material, but this doesn''t look like it''s focused quite right.  The light is too harsh and causing substantial glare.</td>', 'Almost looks like ice cream.  Could be the smoothness of the material, but this doesn''t look like it''s focused quite right.  The light is too harsh and causing substantial glare.', '2009-10-06 10:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676608, 824622, 30049, '<td valign="top">This would be outstanding at dusk with the lights on!  As is, it''s "ok".  Technically meets the challenge and so forth, but not (IMO) that interesting a subject.</td>', 'This would be outstanding at dusk with the lights on!  As is, it''s "ok".  Technically meets the challenge and so forth, but not (IMO) that interesting a subject.', '2009-10-06 10:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676609, 824597, 30049, '<td valign="top">What, you couldn''t get them to smile?!  You really should take their picture more often...they seem so surprised.  :-O</td>', 'What, you couldn''t get them to smile?!  You really should take their picture more often...they seem so surprised.  :-O', '2009-10-06 10:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676610, 824513, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like everything but the handle.  Good detail on the gold metal, and very well lit and focused.</td>', 'I like everything but the handle.  Good detail on the gold metal, and very well lit and focused.', '2009-10-06 10:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676611, 823799, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the blue and blue.  This photo certainly grabs the viewers attention and begs the questions: who, what, where, why?  Looks like something was lost in fur details during processing?</td>', 'I like the blue and blue.  This photo certainly grabs the viewers attention and begs the questions: who, what, where, why?  Looks like something was lost in fur details during processing?', '2009-10-06 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676612, 824286, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you included the pot reflection on the glass in the end result.</td>', 'I like how you included the pot reflection on the glass in the end result.', '2009-10-06 10:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676613, 824667, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful B/W conversion.  Feels like that darn shell piece is interrupting the visual peace and harmony here.  If it was a whole shell it''d be perfect.  I think.  :-)</td>', 'Wonderful B/W conversion.  Feels like that darn shell piece is interrupting the visual peace and harmony here.  If it was a whole shell it''d be perfect.  I think.  :-)', '2009-10-06 10:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676614, 824528, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey.  This is a great catch!  You pulled a double with this one.  Only thing missing is the morning dew on the web strands.  :-)  Somehow I didn''t give this photo justice on my first pass when voting.  Glad I took another look while commenting.  Hope the bump in score helps some.  Good luck!</td>', 'Hey.  This is a great catch!  You pulled a double with this one.  Only thing missing is the morning dew on the web strands.  :-)  Somehow I didn''t give this photo justice on my first pass when voting.  Glad I took another look while commenting.  Hope the bump in score helps some.  Good luck!', '2009-10-06 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676615, 824428, 30049, '<td valign="top">The reflection is fun in giving the viewer something to wander around in...looking for more of the story.  Where?  Who''s the photog?  Why?  Don''t know why, but I didn''t find this quite as interesting the first time thru when voting.  So...I hope you find a small bump in score helpful as I complete my commenting passthru.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The reflection is fun in giving the viewer something to wander around in...looking for more of the story.  Where?  Who''s the photog?  Why?  Don''t know why, but I didn''t find this quite as interesting the first time thru when voting.  So...I hope you find a small bump in score helpful as I complete my commenting passthru.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 10:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676617, 824451, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks a little fuzzy to me.  Yep.  Just checked my glasses and they''re clean.  Hmmm...maybe this is more focused than I thought but not where it needs to be?  The upper-left looks good.  The front center doesn''t.</td>', 'Looks a little fuzzy to me.  Yep.  Just checked my glasses and they''re clean.  Hmmm...maybe this is more focused than I thought but not where it needs to be?  The upper-left looks good.  The front center doesn''t.', '2009-10-06 10:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676619, 824290, 30049, '<td valign="top">What a cool spot in the road!  You might lose some of the curve feel, but did you try a panning shot for the fun of it?</td>', 'What a cool spot in the road!  You might lose some of the curve feel, but did you try a panning shot for the fun of it?', '2009-10-06 10:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676623, 824618, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm....I''m trying to find something to say.  I get where you were coming from on this.  It''s the screw that''s messing this up (IMO).  A nice, fresh, shiny brass (or titanium) wood screw would have been perfect and jumped out.  The one you''ve chosen almost blends in except for the rust.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hmmmm....I''m trying to find something to say.  I get where you were coming from on this.  It''s the screw that''s messing this up (IMO).  A nice, fresh, shiny brass (or titanium) wood screw would have been perfect and jumped out.  The one you''ve chosen almost blends in except for the rust.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 10:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676624, 824599, 30049, '<td valign="top">That is a very cool mane with the braids and I like the glow you''re getting from the light.  The overall comp is a bit bland IMO however.  Those braids may have been a good item for a closeup study perhaps?  Just thinking out loud.  Good luck.</td>', 'That is a very cool mane with the braids and I like the glow you''re getting from the light.  The overall comp is a bit bland IMO however.  Those braids may have been a good item for a closeup study perhaps?  Just thinking out loud.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 10:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676625, 824203, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Wrong rope.  You needed a rustic looking rope for this IMO.</td>', 'Good idea.  Wrong rope.  You needed a rustic looking rope for this IMO.', '2009-10-06 10:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676627, 824410, 30049, '<td valign="top">The blue color cast from your selected light source adds a feeling of sorrow to this image.  Intentional or not.  Not a bad thing...just making an observation.  Good luck.</td>', 'The blue color cast from your selected light source adds a feeling of sorrow to this image.  Intentional or not.  Not a bad thing...just making an observation.  Good luck.', '2009-10-06 10:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5676629, 823657, 30049, '<td valign="top">Another statistic how?  Another tick in the challenges entered column?  Not quite sure what I''m looking at here.  A little bit bizzare, yet not quite an abstract either.  Hmmmm.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Another statistic how?  Another tick in the challenges entered column?  Not quite sure what I''m looking at here.  A little bit bizzare, yet not quite an abstract either.  Hmmmm.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-10-06 10:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
