(5678134, 824143, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Photographer''s Comments:</b></div><hr/><i>The creek is twisted....sheez!</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ahhhhh!  Sorry.  I totally missed that.  Honest!  I guess I found the bride and groom to be the main subject and then the trees took over from there...the creek totally fell off the viewing radar.<br/> <br/>The title made me consider that your intent was "life''s turns", as in getting married and going down a new road.  Was the "turn" meant to be the creek?<br/> <br/>My head hurts...too complicated!  :-P</td>', 'Originally posted by Photographer''s Comments:The creek is twisted....sheez! Ahhhhh!  Sorry.  I totally missed that.  Honest!  I guess I found the bride and groom to be the main subject and then the trees took over from there...the creek totally fell off the viewing radar. The title made me consider that your intent was "life''s turns", as in getting married and going down a new road.  Was the "turn" meant to be the creek? My head hurts...too complicated!  :-P', '2009-10-07 10:24:51.000000', NULL, 0),
