(5679307, 824565, 104378, '<td valign="top">WOW!<br/> <br/>I guess I don''t even have words for this placement....<br/> <br/>Thank u all for voting!<br/> <br/>Basically how the photo went was i dropped the bread tie on the floor and thought... hmmm that would be a cool entry for the challenge so I put the bread loaf down and shot it with my camera as is stood.<br/> <br/>I am not going to twist it and stage the photo like requested that I should do. I basically like to take photo''s that are as they are. <br/>Thanks for all the comments and votes.<br/> <br/>Hep</td>', 'WOW! I guess I don''t even have words for this placement.... Thank u all for voting! Basically how the photo went was i dropped the bread tie on the floor and thought... hmmm that would be a cool entry for the challenge so I put the bread loaf down and shot it with my camera as is stood. I am not going to twist it and stage the photo like requested that I should do. I basically like to take photo''s that are as they are. Thanks for all the comments and votes. Hep', '2009-10-07 21:49:03.000000', NULL, 0),
