(5681700, 824485, 10275, '<td valign="top">I am the one who gave this a 10. I love this photo and I hoped this would do better. When you stare at the centre point, everything else is spinning and twisting - it has a sense of motion. It''s quite brilliant.</td>', 'I am the one who gave this a 10. I love this photo and I hoped this would do better. When you stare at the centre point, everything else is spinning and twisting - it has a sense of motion. It''s quite brilliant.', '2009-10-09 13:24:02.000000', NULL, 0),
